omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rTOn3CM_oEUQ7kNvwEzoUkl&_nc_oc=AdqraIgPJizZgyF7D5zpCBsfsvzzMmzT41Buo0ZK7Lnbq9_ysMKpRQmfsjW_Fmk0_gc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKXN3okM6_CYbmq1H1N-3FUiP-NZu717N5Ta28474BHtg&oe=6AA02834"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1UmzXLXRqxUQ7kNvwHPZscJ&_nc_oc=AdqD1C2mQzQNeLyHxOh1LD2gFR3k5ofKtDW9xsMxy0P4fnVTRkRrVHy7OpqjGN50bi8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJhXB8xpdewv0Mlr5kqBShuZ0wRHw4AkHnAvcKnBUBtjQ&oe=6AA02996"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TJYd5DkN-aQQ7kNvwGh3FSG&_nc_oc=Adr_mm_EVwGms2aemWDjRA3zMQvtGQOEJeVtOrVMoqgxHo5EYXcUkH6kn76QXQ9Wokk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL-mSM2LmeAr1SllzCmKGguvZXDpqCpfFC59MGBaDweYw&oe=6AA00677"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://